WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.360
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls to summon forth Aqua Regina-sama.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.280
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.450
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.370
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:24.310
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.060
You say you have a new plan?

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.180
No, Gaito-sama.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:14.820
It's more like a new battle strategy.

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.320
Right, Sister Mimi?

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:21.200
Yeah. If I had to describe it, those Mermaid Princesses are obsessed with true love.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.040
So we thought of a new battle strategy.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:28.260
Yes. In short, we'll use love to pin down the Mermaid Princesses.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.110
That should work out.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:31.460
How true.

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:34.670
So... what kind of a plan is this?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.010
Explain it to me.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:41.310
Instead of us explaining everything, it'd be faster if we show you, Gaito-sama.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.370
Come out! The three Tachi brothers.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:50.860
We're using them to pin down the Mermaid Princesses and toy with their feelings.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:55.760
Please leave this mission to us, the three Tachi brothers, Gaito-sama.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:03:00.100
As long as we work together, no woman will ever escape from our clutches.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.810
Moreover, it's those lovey-dovey Mermaid Princesses. It'll be a breeze.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.510
Well, that's fine. I'll let both of you continue with your plans.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.410
Using the three Tachi brothers,

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:13.320
We will definitely catch those Mermaid Princesses.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.590
Song of Suspicion.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.500
Big trouble! We've got big trouble!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.380
What happened, Hanon? You're so worked up.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.760
Both of you take a look at this!

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:29.860
What is it?

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.710
A skateboarding event, huh?

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:32.800
Let me see.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:35.570
Three skateboarding brothers will be making an appearance.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.780
But Hanon, what's so bad about that?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.660
What are you saying!?

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:45.250
Lucia, how can you be so calm when three handsome guys are going to be there?

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.320
So that's what this is about.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:52.820
Geez, Hanon. Every time you hear about handsome guys, you have to jump all over them.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:54.240
You two are idiots.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:57.940
Won't it be a waste if there are handsome guys to see?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.760
I have to say I do have a little bit of an interest in skateboarding.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.600
Right!?

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.620
Rina, let's go together!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:04.930
Lucia, you won't go, right?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.160
Why does it have to end up like that!?

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.300
If you two are going, of course I'll go too.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.160
See!

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.640
You actually want to see the handsome guys, too.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:20.230
That's not it. But if only you two go, it'll be boring to be all alone here.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.920
Right, we have to strike the iron while it's hot.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:25.550
So let's go to the skateboard event quick!

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.440
Right now?

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.590
You are a bit outdated with your "let's go!"

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.500
I just don't get it.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.130
Why must we go when there are handsome guys?

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.070
I wonder what she's doing over there.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:50.770
I don't know.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.320
Isn't she also looking for handsome guys?

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:56.850
Geez, Hanon. Not all girls are like you.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:02.420
That person looks very sad.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.510
I guess we should go home.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:16.490
What's with you!?

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.780
You're the one who wanted to come here.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.730
That's true, but...

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:22.710
What's the matter, Hanon?

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:27.220
Something doesn't seem right. The event doesn't have that kind of feeling.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.200
There were a lot of handsome guys who just passed by, but you didn't even give them a look.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.510
Even for Hanon...

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.660
It's a rare sight!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.830
I wonder if it's going to rain?

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.630
Even I can choose a boyfriend.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:46.340
Eh!? Really? I didn't know that.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:50.030
Hanon, do you really understand the meaning of "choosing a boyfriend?"

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.340
You're rude.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.510
Of course I know the meaning of that.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:54.980
Hi, baby.

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:57.400
You three are in a good mood.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.910
Do you want to play with us?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.290
Who are they?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.450
They're really lame.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:06.150
Well, at least someone finally approached us.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.360
But you didn't have to put it so bluntly.

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.470
I don't know, but they didn't seem to notice us that much.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.700
Could it be we're too handsome, and that they're in shock?

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.130
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.660
What!?

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.710
You three are making assumptions!

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.660
You fool! I don't have the time to play with you three.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:25.640
I'm going home.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.570
I guess we should too.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.080
You mean we got turned down?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.770
I'm sure they're only embarrassed. That's why they lied.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.570
No doubt about it.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:35.790
Let's get them to say what they really think of us.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.380
Hey, girlfriend!

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:41.290
Want to go with us and watch the sea this morning?

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.390
Would some coffee this morning-

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.080
Are you alright, brother?

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.670
Hang in there, brother!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.850
No, I can't live much longer.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.430
Baby, can you please help my brother?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.310
Only you three can save our brother.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.380
Help you how?

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:02.610
You just have to agree to a date with us.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.720
Date?

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:05.890
I'm going back home.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:06.450
Rina!

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.210
We're begging! Please! We beg you!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:10.020
Please!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.080
Even if you say that...

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:16.580
Guess we have to, since they're already on their knees.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.690
Thank you! We're really grateful!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:19.660
Thank you!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:22.490
Didn't you say you won't live much longer?

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.330
Well, I didn't really believe him, though.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.980
The sea's beautiful, isn't it?

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.280
It's just as beautiful as your eyes, baby.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.950
Blue sky, white clouds.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:44.850
You know, it's just like they have planned this for our meeting.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:51.110
Both of us together like this. It really enriches our hearts.

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.110
Why am I the only one alone!?

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:56.260
It's no fun at all.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.610
What's the matter? Are you jealous?

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:00.270
You look shameful, brother.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.830
Have you two forgotten our mission, as to why we're really here?

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:04.710
Mission?

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.200
Excuse me, I have something to ask you.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:08.910
Yes?

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:09.890
What's it?

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.380
What is your mission?

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:15.180
We have to find the Mermaid Princesses and capture them!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:19.930
What!? Find the Mermaid Princesses and capture them!?

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.700
That's top secret.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:23.890
Ah, that's right.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.430
What's with these guys?

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.740
Anyway, we have to accomplish our mission.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.620
It's a water gun!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:31.690
This is bad!

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:39.370
They both fell in.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.370
Hey, Sister Mimi.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.920
I wonder how capable the three Tachi brothers really are.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:53.580
To be honest, I'm not really expecting much from them, Sister Sheshe.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:57.690
But to think of new battle plans again and again, it's so tiring.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.400
You're right.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.870
We were really exaggerating in front of Gaito-sama.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.640
We really don't have that much confidence in it.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.400
Still, we should check out the situation.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.770
They might have captured the Mermaid Princesses already.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.530
You're right. Let's take a look.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.900
Since we're just sitting around.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.360
So here you are, Sara.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.060
Gaito, what's the matter?

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:33.830
Sara, I haven't seen you around much lately.

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:40.630
Geez, Gaito. Does it really make you that uneasy if you don't see me?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:44.600
Sara, where exactly does your heart lie?

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:49.980
Oh my. Of course, my heart lies with you, Gaito.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:53.410
Sara, could it be you're...

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:53.950
What?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.860
No, it's nothing.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:02.790
You're acting weird.

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:05.730
Why do you look so sad?

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:09.000
That kind of face doesn't suit you.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.400
Sara.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.970
Do you want to have an afternoon nap?

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:15.620
Care to use my lap as a pillow, Gaito?

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.310
That was close.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.970
Are they the minions of the water demons?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.010
Probably.

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:30.440
They followed us!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.620
They're really bothersome.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.030
It's the Mermaid Princesses.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:36.580
It's true. When did they get here?

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:37.710
By the way, brother...

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:40.300
Where exactly did Lucia and her friend go?

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:44.700
Could it be they haven't realized who we are?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.630
That seems to be the case.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.970
Could they be that dumb?

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.450
Lucia-chan, where are you!?

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:53.390
Hanon-chan! Come out and flirt with me!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.940
How much longer are the two of you going to keep acting lovey-dovey?

00:10:55.940 --> 00:11:01.880
Hurry up and capture the Mermaid Princesses in front of us, and offer them to the Black Beauty Sisters!

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.220
That's right. The Mermaid Princesses, huh?

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.120
Since it's work, I guess it can't be helped.

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:07.800
What should we do, Hanon?

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:08.810
Well...

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.040
I don't really want to worry about them.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.360
But we should finish them off first.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:13.890
Yeah.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:19.440
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.440
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.880
Stop with all this love nonsense.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:36.990
Pichi Pichitto Live Start!

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.050
Ayaa!

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.350
What is this!?

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.920
That's why I said we should hurry up and capture them!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.710
Hang in there! We're coming to save you, brothers!

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:19.410
Oh! Shirou, Gorou and Rokurou!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:21.760
Shichirou, Hachirou, Kurou, and Juurou!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.840
Why are there so many brothers!?

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.110
Who are they!?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:35.090
Presented by Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:59.560
What's happening? How can such a song exist in the world? {changed the start to 55.80 from 55.68, to allow for proper collision resolution -Lexi}

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.380
We were too naïve, we didn't know about that!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.420
It hurts!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:32.020
Love Shower Pitch!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.250
How about an encore?

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:38.680
Forgive us!

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:41.410
Oh my, they all ran away.

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:42.390
What?

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:44.000
That was easy.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.630
Oh my, is that so?

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.710
To think that we'd find two Mermaid Princesses.

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.060
How true.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.510
We're pretty lucky today.

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:55.960
Let's hurry up and capture them.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:57.970
It's the Black Beauty Sisters!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.830
It's Show Time!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.360
Lucia, Hanon.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:44.460
This time, we defeated the Pink and Aqua mermaids easily.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.830
How true.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:50.630
Green Pearl Voice!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.150
Damn it.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:17.000
When did she get here?

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.040
Rina!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.940
Come on, let's sing together.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.730
Love Shower Pitch!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.410
How about an encore?

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:47.830
We'll let you go for today!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.830
Don't get too conceited!

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.080
I came here again.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.700
What am I looking for by coming here?

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.470
When my heart should only have hatred in it...

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:35.680
My heart is full of hatred for that person.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:38.070
And I've lived on depending on that hatred.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.480
Yet, what am I doing now?

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.450
Sara, where exactly does your heart lie?

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.320
Up until now, I've stayed alive for only one thing.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:51.090
Only for my revenge.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.290
That alone has kept me going.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.160
This song, can it be...

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:14.380
S-Sara...

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.610
Wait, is that you, Sara?

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:20.220
Sara!

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:27.390
Huh? The person swimming over there... isn't that Mitsuki-sensei?

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.410
You're right.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:32.870
What exactly is he doing?

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:35.050
He seems to be acting strange, isn't he?

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.330
Tarou-chan!

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:43.050
Sara, are you singing this song?

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.260
Is it you!?

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.830
Your hair used to be really beautiful.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.270
Mitsuki, why did you betray me!?

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:33.930
Who is she!?

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:36.170
What exactly is she doing to Tarou-chan!?

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:43.680
Mitsuki...

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:54.680
Why are you looking at me with such gentle eyes?

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:59.050
Stop it, Mitsuki! Don't look at me with those eyes!

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:12.000
That was close.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.750
Just a little longer and he would have drowned.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.100
Who exactly was that mermaid?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.470
How do you feel, Mitsuki-sensei?

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.440
What exactly happened to me?

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.070
You jumped into the sea all of a sudden.

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:30.280
Just a little longer and you would've drowned.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:32.510
What happened, sensei?

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.650
Sensei?

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:41.710
I'm sorry, everybody.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:44.090
Can you all go back home for today?

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:46.700
I want to be alone.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:49.040
Tarou-chan...

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:02.540
Mitsuki...

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:13.720
Sara... I want to see you again once more.

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:53.770
Suddenly, the snowing became very heavy.

00:23:53.770 --> 00:23:55.770
Or rather, it became a blizzard.

00:23:55.770 --> 00:23:58.780
Lucia went to give Kaito her lunch box... will she be okay?

00:23:58.780 --> 00:24:04.010
Kaito went out looking for Lucia, but will they meet each other safely?

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:06.940
They could be in trouble.

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:11.220
I hope they took shelter somewhere.

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:14.330
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:14.330 --> 00:24:15.480
Miracle on a Snowy Night.

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:16.960
How about an encore?

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:19.170
You two, please be safe.
